# Curated portfolio screenshots are published assets, not scratch captures. Several rules above
# (marketing-*.png, children-*.png, *-mobile-*.png ...) were written for throwaway QA output and
# silently swallowed portfolio/screenshots/marketing-home.png, which the README embeds. Negate the
# whole curated directory so a gallery can never publish as broken links.
!portfolio/screenshots/**
